      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "- **Langfuse** (traces, per-call cost): https://langfuse.obseum.cloud\n- **LiteLLM** admin UI (keys, budgets, spend logs): https://litellm.obseum.cloud/ui\n- Counters restart with the LiteLLM container; ranges use `increase()`, which handles the resets."
